{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 116,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "I love the LORD, because he listens to my voice, and my cries for mercy.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "116:1 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我爱耶和华，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我愛耶和華，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Because he has turned his ear to me, therefore I will call on him as long as I live.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他既向我侧耳，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他既向我側耳，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "The cords of death surrounded me, the pains of Sheol got a hold of me. I found trouble and sorrow.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "116:3 Sheol is the place of the dead."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "死亡的绳索缠绕我；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "死亡的繩索纏繞我；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Then I called on the LORD’s name: LORD, I beg you, deliver my soul.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那时，我便求告耶和华的名，说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那時，我便求告耶和華的名，說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD is gracious and righteous. our God is merciful.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华有恩惠，有公义；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華有恩惠，有公義；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD preserves the simple. I was brought low, and he saved me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华保护愚人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華保護愚人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Return to your rest, my soul, for the LORD has dealt bountifully with you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的心哪！你要仍归安乐，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的心哪！你要仍歸安樂，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "For you have delivered my soul from death, my eyes from tears, and my feet from falling.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "主啊，你救我的命免了死亡，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "主啊，你救我的命免了死亡，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will walk before the LORD in the land of the living.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要在耶和华面前行活人之路。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要在耶和華面前行活人之路。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "I believed, therefore I said, I was greatly afflicted.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我因信，所以如此说话；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我因信，所以如此說話；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "I said in my haste, All people are liars.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我曾急促地说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我曾急促地說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "What will I give to the LORD for all his benefits toward me?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我拿什么报答耶和华向我所赐的一切厚恩？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我拿甚麼報答耶和華向我所賜的一切厚恩？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will take the cup of salvation, and call on the LORD’s name.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要举起救恩的杯，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要舉起救恩的杯，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will pay my vows to the LORD, in the presence of all his people.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要在他众民面前向耶和华还我的愿。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要在他眾民面前向耶和華還我的願。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "Precious in the LORD’s sight is the death of his saints.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "在耶和华眼中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "在耶和華眼中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD, truly I am your servant. I am your servant, the son of your servant girl. You have freed me from my chains.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，我真是你的仆人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，我真是你的僕人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will offer to you the sacrifice of thanksgiving, and will call on the LORD’s name.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要以感谢为祭献给你，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要以感謝為祭獻給你，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will pay my vows to the LORD, in the presence of all his people,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18-19",
      "en": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要在他众民面前， 当中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要在他眾民面前， 當中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "in the courts of the LORD’s house, in the middle of you, Jerusalem. Praise the LORD!",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "116:19 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}